    "Task 59 retired the phase-4 editor and its TypeScript twin of the algebra,",
    "and with it tests/timelineFixtures.test.ts and its size guard: Rust keeps",
    "the table as the record of the algebra every saved phase-4 cut on disk was",
    "made with; the migration itself reads a cut through from_sidecar_value only.",
    "Why it exists, and what each row pins, is in timeline.rs.",
    "toSourceMs rows are [outputMs, expectedSourceMs]; null means past the end.",
    "isUntouched rows are [sourceDurationMs, expected] for Timeline::is_untouched",
    "-- the predicate the retired phase-5 export's fast path keyed on; now read",
    "by the staged list's edited label and by render_plan's",
    "identity_detection_matches_is_untouched cross-check. RUST ASSERTS THESE,",
    "and requires every case to declare the field, so a new case cannot skip it."
